  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "結束了，特米米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "......還、還沒有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "努爾，佩塔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪倫",
      "text": "博士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "博士——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "不想讓你的同伴受到傷害的話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "別逼我生氣啊，特米米！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "......嘉維爾你不留下來的話，我是不會收手的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪倫",
      "text": "救我啊，博士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "博士，我好怕嗚嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "交給你的任務完成了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "迪倫",
              "text": "博士，別這麼不上道嘛，小姑娘這麼情真意切，配合一下又不會死。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "text": "唉，這裡的人這麼淳樸，老實說，欺騙他們讓我有些良心不安呢，雖然我沒有心。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "迪倫",
              "text": "哎呀，博士，你別用那種眼神看著我。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "迪倫",
              "text": "安心，我怎麼也是羅德島的幹員，這點小事都做不好怎麼行。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不要怕！我這就來救你們！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "text": "博士——！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Lancet-2！",
          "value": "4",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "誒？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
              "text": "什麼時候掙脫的！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "迪倫",
              "text": "哈哈，抱歉啊，其實從一開始就沒綁住。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "博士，難道你早就料到了特米米會這麼做？",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "博士——！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪倫",
          "text": "哇，你們兩個演的比我還起勁啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "當然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "想不發現才難。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "你你你、你是怎麼發現的？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "首先，是你在第一次提到祖瑪瑪時出現的猶豫。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "啊？猶豫？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "然後，是在祭典時，你對嘉維爾突然行動的驚慌。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "最後，迪倫，東西呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪倫",
          "text": "哦，我放在Lancet-2身上了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "嗚嗚......要不是為了博士，我可不會輕易讓人在我身體裡放東西哦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "這是......火箭筒？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪倫",
          "text": "對，在特米米的部族裡找到的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "難道說......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪倫",
          "text": "沒錯，把我們轟下來的罪魁禍首，就是這個小丫頭啦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "特米米。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗚嗚嗚，我錯了，嘉維爾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "過來。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗚嗚嗚......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "趴到我大腿上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嘉維爾，你不要打我，我知道錯了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "那可不行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "對付不聽話的小鬼，當然要打尾巴！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗚嗚嗚......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "text": "打尾巴，好像很痛的樣子......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "知道錯了嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "知道錯了，嗚嗚嗚......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "知道錯了就好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "總之，這下應該算是沒事了，博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "累了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "哈哈哈，確實這一連串發生的事還挺多的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "喂，博士，你該不會站著睡著了吧。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你剛才居然沒有用那招什麼大風車。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "我當然不會傷到特米米這孩子啊。唉，我可是都有點累了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "這個大傢伙......乍一看雖然好像很醜，但是這個棱角，粗獷的設計感，雜亂卻有效的線路連接，仔細看看有一種獨特的美。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "嗯，是適合結婚的類型呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哦，Lancet-2，你快去看看引擎還有沒有救。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "誒？難道引擎在這個大傢伙身上？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "對啊，被我們打爆了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "哇，可憐的引擎，可憐的大個子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "迪倫先生，可以過來幫我個忙嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪倫",
          "text": "好的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "喂，祖瑪瑪，你怎麼了，傻站在那兒。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "嘉維爾，嘉維爾！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "啊？幹什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "那個，那個！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哪個啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "那個，那個會動會說話的機器是怎麼回事！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哦，你說Lancet-2啊，她是我們的同伴啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我、我可以和她說話嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "這有什麼不行的？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "那個，你好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "你好？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你是機器嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "我的產品名稱是雷神存在者S—Typer62六輪作業平台，隸屬羅德島，代號Lancet-2。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "哦哦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "是的，我擁有一定程度的智慧，如果是不怎麼困難的問題的話，我應該可以為你解答。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "順便一提，作為面向醫療的作業平台，我的知識儲備偏向醫療方面，這點還請注意哦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "^%&$*#(#......！！！！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "有什麼事嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我可以抱抱你嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "誒？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "那傢伙在幹什麼啊，腦子進水了嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "這不是很明顯嗎，她被那台機器震懾了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "就像她第一次見到移動城市時的震撼一樣，一台能自己行動，還會自己說話的機器對她的衝擊，比那還要大！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "別說她了，我也興奮得不行好嗎！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "噢，這位美麗的小姐，我可以有幸邀請你進行一次約會嗎！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "我知道這片雨林中景色最美的地方，讓我們去那裡度過一個美好的下午吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "咦，我、我被邀請了嗎？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "text": "怎麼辦，稍微有點開心......博士，我應該接受嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "接受吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "森蚺",
              "text": "大祭司，你不要搶，不然別怪我不顧我們這麼多年的情誼。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "老實說，我現在和博士心情相同。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "有點想笑。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不准搶走我的Lancet-2！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "text": "誒，博士，你忽然這樣說，我還沒有做好心理準備......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "嘉維爾，你們那裡能造出這樣的機器嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "啊？呃，我覺得可露希爾應該可以吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "好。我決定了，嘉維爾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你的那個叫羅德島的地方還缺人嗎，我也要加入你們。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我要去你們那裡學習機械技術。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
