        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哈哈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "咦，我呢？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "你的下一個任務在上個星期就準備好了，理論上來說你已經拖延了很久。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "哦......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "這對你來說應當是一次有些脫離常識的旅行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "但是，如同嘉維爾的性格一樣，這也是這片大地充滿生機的證明。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "漫長的時間中，許多事物已經被磨滅了它原有的色彩，過去的理所當然變成了如今的難能可貴。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "我們不得不去尋找人群的細縫間所漏出的光明，並把這種行為視作常態。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "希望這次旅行能讓你和同行的幹員明白，有些東西並非遙不可及。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "凱爾希，該開會了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "我知道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "那麼，Dr.{@nickname}，還有許多工作在等著你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "希望你在這次休假中獲得了足夠的休息。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
